      "hizbQuarter": 131,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2562,
      "text": "We made Solomon understand it[32], although We gave each of them sound judgment and knowledge. We subjected the mountains and birds to glorify Allah along with David. It was We Who did all this.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 21,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنبِيَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anbiyaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prophets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 112,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 79,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 328,
      "ruku": 283,
      "hizbQuarter": 131,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2563,
      "text": "And We taught him[33] the art of making coats of mail for you to protect yourselves in your battle. Will you then be grateful?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 21,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنبِيَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anbiyaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prophets",
